
### ============================================
### VARIABLES
### ============================================
### Change @baseUrl to match your environment:
### - Local development: http://localhost:3001
### - Docker development: http://localhost:3001
### - Production: https://api.yourdomain.com
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@graphId=9b198af5-831b-4e86-8fb7-72e49198f84d


### ============================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ============================================

### Root endpoint - API Welcome
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/health

###


### ============================================
### 2. GRAPH UPLOAD - SUCCESS CASES
### ============================================

### Upload a valid graph with multiple edges (distance and time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": 15 },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "distance": 5, "time": 8 },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "distance": 8, "time": 12 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "distance": 12, "time": 20 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "distance": 12, "time": 18 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "F", "distance": 4, "time": 6 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "G", "distance": 4, "time": 5 },
    { "from": "E", "to": "G", "distance": 9, "time": 14 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "H", "distance": 8, "time": 10 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "H", "distance": 4, "time": 7 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "H", "distance": 1, "time": 2 }
  ]
}

###

### Upload a simple graph with single edge
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "X", "to": "Y", "distance": 25, "time": 30 }
  ]
}

###

### Upload a graph optimized for shortest distance
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 100, "time": 60 },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "distance": 50, "time": 120 },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "distance": 50, "time": 30 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "distance": 100, "time": 20 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "distance": 80, "time": 45 }
  ]
}

###

### Upload a graph with highway types for constraint testing
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "distance": 20, "time": 15, "type": "road" },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "distance": 25, "time": 20, "type": "road" },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "C", "to": "E", "distance": 30, "time": 25, "type": "street" }
  ]
}

###


### ============================================
### 3. READ GRAPH - GET NODES
### ============================================

### Get graph by ID (success case)
### Note: Replace {graphId} with actual UUID from upload response
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/8271288b-52ee-449c-9e12-aaef821b752c


###

### Get graph with invalid ID (not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### Get graph with empty ID (bad request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/

###


### ============================================
### 4. ERROR HANDLING - VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'from' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": 15 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'to' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "distance": 10, "time": 15 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'distance' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "time": 15 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'time' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - negative distance
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": -5, "time": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - negative time
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": -5 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - zero distance
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 0, "time": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - empty edges array
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": []
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - empty node names
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "", "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": 15 }
  ]
}

###


### ============================================
### 5. ROUTE OPTIMIZATION - DIJKSTRA'S ALGORITHM
### ============================================

### Calculate optimal route - shortest distance (default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "D",
  "preference": "shortest"
}

###

### Calculate optimal route - fastest time
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "D",
  "preference": "fastest"
}

###

### Calculate optimal route - without preference (defaults to shortest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "D"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - missing destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - same origin and destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "A"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - invalid preference
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "H",
  "preference": "cheapest"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - graph not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "H"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - origin node not found in graph
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "Z",
  "destinationNodeId": "H"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - destination node not found in graph
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "Z"
}

###


### ============================================
### 6. CONSTRAINT FILTERING - AVOID HIGHWAYS
### ============================================
@highwayGraphId=17eab985-9393-407f-a7b5-e052d2272830

### Upload a graph with highway edges for constraint testing
### Note: Use the graph ID returned from the previous upload with highways
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "distance": 20, "time": 15, "type": "road" },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "distance": 25, "time": 20, "type": "road" },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "distance": 10, "time": 5, "type": "highway" },
    { "from": "C", "to": "E", "distance": 30, "time": 25, "type": "street" }
  ]
}

###

### Route without constraints - uses highway (shorter distance: A->B->D->E = 30)
### Replace {{highwayGraphId}} with the ID from the previous response
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{highwayGraphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "E",
  "preference": "shortest"
}

###

### Route with avoidHighways=true - avoids highways (longer distance: A->C->D->C->E = 75)
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{highwayGraphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "E",
  "preference": "shortest",
  "constraints": {
    "avoidHighways": true
  }
}

###

### Route with avoidHighways=false - uses highways (default behavior)
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{highwayGraphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "E",
  "preference": "shortest",
  "constraints": {
    "avoidHighways": false
  }
}

###

### Route with avoidHighways and fastest preference - avoids highways
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{highwayGraphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "E",
  "preference": "fastest",
  "constraints": {
    "avoidHighways": true
  }
}

###

### Error: No route possible when avoiding highways (if all paths blocked)
### This tests when constraints make the destination unreachable
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{highwayGraphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "E",
  "preference": "shortest",
  "constraints": {
    "avoidHighways": true
  }
}

###

